# NFL photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Philadelphia Eagles elite cut (V-neck, short sleeves with cuff bands, upper-back nameplate, mesh fabric). Solid `#000` (LED energy). No hanger on photo backs.

**Scale lock:** full original silhouette, aspect locked, neckline pinned to the top. Hem crop **15%**, then the remaining kit is **+10%** (`background-size: auto 129.4%`, `background-position: center top`). Font caps: name ~**7vh**, number ~**28.6vh**.

**Helmet:** Optional side mascot/helmet in PNG only after jersey stack is locked; must not touch the right sleeve.

**Wordmark:** baked into the PNG only (club on nameplate). Upright athletic block caps. CSS hides `.soccer-jersey-team` on photo kits.

**Patron name (CSS):** just under the baked nameplate, clear of the collar and wordmark, base `top` ~38% + `var(--nfl-photo-stack-y)` (96× ~37%, 64×48 ~36%, 64×32 ~34%); cap ~6.4vh.

**Number (CSS):** empty mid-back, base `top` ~48% + shift (96× ~47%, 64×48 ~46%, 64×32 ~44%); cap ~26–28.6vh and clearly larger than the name.

**Dual shoutout layout (`nfl-jersey` / `nflDualLayout`):**
- **96×48:** jersey left-justified; white text shoutout on the right (4 lines × 16 = 64 graphemes, emoji OK); FloqR card bottom; kit-color edge glow. Shout panel fills the **right half**.
- **64×48 / 64×32:** rotate jersey phase ↔ text phase every **6s** via `FLOQRFrameLoop` (frame 2 = **solid black** + white shoutout; jersey fully hidden). FloqR card on both. **64×48:** 4 lines × 16 = 64; **64×32:** 3 lines × 16 = 48. Text phase fills **almost the entire board** (glow edges + FloqR card reserved); `fitNflShoutPanel` measure-fits a uniform font to the full entered copy.
- FloqR card Instagram/handle is **opt-in** and **independent** of jersey name (`includeAttribution` + `attributionChoice` vs `soccerNameSource` / `jerseyPatronName`). Checkout must use `nflJersey` text caps (not soccer 8–12).

